    <content contentuid="h9e880ab0g1af4g4b5cga2c2g7a71cbe98034" version="1">Roll with Advantage</content>
    <content contentuid="h8e7389fcg5e0fg49a3g8621g696442f1e624" version="1">Gain &lt;LSTag Tooltip="Advantage"&gt;Advantage&lt;/LSTag&gt; on all skill checks/throws.</content>
