    <content contentuid="h3c167fa3gb47cg4634ga7aag2372669ee0e5" version="1">You have advantage, but -50 to all rolls.</content>

    <content contentuid="h73962452g7946g49d9g9944g7b739f5a53ab" version="1">Protection from the Dumb</content>
    <content contentuid="h9f70bb97gf1d4g4160g88bbg2127ace778dc" version="1">Useful for keeping dumb NPC's from craving death too hard.</content>
